    {
      "id": "03-fats",
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "fats",
      "text": "0.6 grams of fat. Cholesterol is 0 milligrams, keeping the fat tradeoff clean. Monounsaturated fat is only 0.02 grams, so there is barely any useful fat here. For vegetables, fat is not really the job anyway.",
